<title>USA: GM will sell Hughes to Raytheon.</title>
<headline>GM will sell Hughes to Raytheon.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors Corp.'s Hughes Aircraft defense subsidiary will be sold to Raytheon Co. in a deal valued at $9.5 billion, the automaker announced Thursday.</p>
<p>The announcement made Raytheon the winner in a bidding war with Northrop Grumman Corp.</p>
